<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8579" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Clĕōnae</span></b> ,
		ārum (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Clĕōna</span></b> , ae, <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 2,
		9</span></i>), f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κλεωναί</span>.
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A small town in Argolis</i>, <i>near
				Nemea</i>, <i>where Hercules killed the lion</i>,
			now <i>Clenia</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 33,
				14, 11</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 6, 417</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 5,
				6, § 12</span></i>.—Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Clĕōnaeus</span></b> ,
				a, um, adj., <i>of</i>
			or <i>pertaining to Cleonœ</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ager,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					33, 14, 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">leo,</span>”
				i. e. <i>the Nemean lion</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Luc.
					4, 612</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Sil. 3, 34</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sidus = leo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					S. 4, 28</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Mart. 4, 60</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">stirpis, i.e. Herculeae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Stat.
					Th. 6, 837</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A town in Macedonia</i>, <i>on Mount
				Athos</i>, <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 2, 9</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 10,
				17, § 37</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
